    "task_class": {
      "description": "Task complexity classification。AIPOS-F104 件④: 值域与每级治理要求唯一声明于此, 代码只读(task_complexity.validate_task_complexity / suggest_workflow_roles, CLI draft create --task-class choices)。每值: required_fields = 卡面必须非空的字段; distinct_pairs = 两字段均非空时不得相同(职责分离); dependency_gate = depends_on 须带 dependency_condition 并按条件校验; orchestration_continuity = orchestration 活跃时须声明 continuity planner; code_mode_advisory = code 模式卡取此级时出复核提示; suggested_workflow = 角色数建议(仅提示, 永不自动套用)。",
      "default": "simple",
      "values": [
        {
          "value": "simple",
          "description": "Simple task - straightforward implementation",
          "required_fields": [],
          "distinct_pairs": [],
          "dependency_gate": false,
          "orchestration_continuity": false,
          "code_mode_advisory": true,
          "suggested_workflow": "1-role"
        },
        {
          "value": "standard",
          "description": "Standard task - moderate complexity: 须独立审计(audit_by 必填且不得等于 assigned_to), 不要求 planner_agent/reviewer 与依赖门(出卡常用的中等复杂度)",
          "required_fields": ["audit_by"],
          "distinct_pairs": [["assigned_to", "audit_by"]],
          "dependency_gate": false,
          "orchestration_continuity": false,
          "code_mode_advisory": false,
          "suggested_workflow": "2-role"
        },
        {
          "value": "complex",
          "description": "Complex task - high complexity, multiple components: planner_agent/reviewer/audit_by 必填且职责分离, 依赖门与编排连续性校验",
          "required_fields": ["planner_agent", "reviewer", "audit_by"],
          "distinct_pairs": [["planner_agent", "reviewer"], ["planner_agent", "audit_by"], ["assigned_to", "reviewer"], ["assigned_to", "audit_by"]],
          "dependency_gate": true,
          "orchestration_continuity": true,
          "code_mode_advisory": false,
          "suggested_workflow": "2-role"
        }
      ]
